     <actual value="The Population Councils (PC) GIRL Center is creating 
research products and opportunities for bilaterals, multilaterals, service delivery organisations 
and governments to make program design and policy decisions vis-a-vis adolescent health and 
wellbeing based on evidence. By influencing adolescent-focused programs and policies to be 
more evidence based, PC is enabling more impactful use of funds in this sector and improving
health and well-being for AGYW. Through the range of 
activities undertaken with Danish support, PC has become a one-stop-shop for all things related 
to data, evidence and adolescent girls. PC achieves  impact by making online data tools 
available, including the Adolescent Atlas for Action and the Adolescent Girls Community of 
Practice."></actual>
